WEBVTT
Kind: subtitles
Language: en

1
00:00.120 --> 00:02.860
This project has been really hard for me.

2
00:02.920 --> 00:07.260
I'm working on two different projects right now
and it's just too much.

3
00:07.320 --> 00:10.300
I've also been feeling disconnected from this team,

4
00:10.360 --> 00:13.820
and I don't have the full picture
of what we're trying to accomplish.

5
00:13.880 --> 00:20.060
Honestly, Alisha, I think we need to step back as a team
and align on priorities and deadlines.

6
00:20.120 --> 00:25.260
I could use some clarity, especially when it comes
to dependencies across work streams.

7
00:25.320 --> 00:31.180
Also, confidentially, I'm feeling a ton of pressure
coming out of my last performance review.

8
00:31.240 --> 00:34.940
So I didn't want to raise a flag that this is just too much work,

9
00:35.000 --> 00:40.540
but honestly, it feels like I'm trying to do two full-time jobs
and failing at both.

10
00:40.600 --> 00:45.900
And I think each of my team leaders believes
that their project is my primary assignment.

11
00:45.960 --> 00:50.060
It just feels like I'm letting everyone down.
